      "trackName": "1942 Fighter",
      "description": "Take to the skies in 1942 Mini, a fast-paced homage to the classic arcade shooter.\n\nUse the Digital Crown to dodge left and right, weaving between waves of enemy fire.\n\nTap the screen to perform a loop-the-loop and escape danger just in time.\n\nDesigned specially for Apple Watch, this mini version keeps the spirit of the original alive. Simple, instant action that fits on your wrist.\n\nSmooth controls, crisp pixel graphics, and satisfying sound effects make every quick game feel like a trip back to the arcade.\n\nHow long can you survive over the endless ocean skies?",
